<title>USA: Adaptec sees charge from acquisition.</title>
<headline>Adaptec sees charge from acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>MILPITAS, Calif. 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Adaptec Inc said on Thursday it expects to take a one-time charge of $0.70-$0.75 a share in the fiscal second quarter, ended September 27, for the in-process research and development acquired in its recently announced purchase of Data Kinesis Inc.</p>
<p>In August, Adaptec said it would acquire the Nashua, N.H.-based software company for $44 million in stock and cash.</p>
